WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.200
Let’s walk through Follow move, phase, and timer

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:03.388
.

00:00:03.388 --> 00:00:07.412
Anchor every facilitation decision to the shared exercise window.

00:00:07.412 --> 00:00:09.562
Name the active state for the room, then keep

00:00:09.562 --> 00:00:11.537
the deck and handoff aligned with it;

00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:14.438
timing context should never be inferred later.

00:00:14.438 --> 00:00:17.675
On this slide, the header shows Strategic Orientation before

00:00:17.675 --> 00:00:20.387
Move 1, then the live move, phase,

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:23.250
countdown timer, and paused or running state so the

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.962
projected deck stays in sync with the room.

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:29.385
In practice, name the active window for the room

00:00:29.385 --> 00:00:33.210
before moving the discussion or finalizing a handoff.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:36.873
Use the highlighted Live tracker area as your visual reference

00:00:36.873 --> 00:00:38.635
while you complete this check.
